\name{quickstart_dataset_paths}
\alias{quickstart_dataset_paths}
\title{Locate the bundled real quickstart example dataset}
\usage{
quickstart_dataset_paths()
}
\value{
A list with \code{directory}, \code{vcf}, and \code{metadata} paths.
}
\description{
A small, real 1000 Genomes chromosome 22 subset (160 samples, 8 populations) bundled with the package so a new user can see real popgenVCF output without downloading anything. See \code{inst/extdata/quickstart/README.md} for full provenance, and \code{vignette("quickstart", package = "popgenVCF")} for a complete walkthrough.
}
